{
  "packet": 2,
  "translations": [
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0075D0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"你倒谦虚。在我看来，你也完全称得上是个伟大的人。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0075D0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"萨特说的？也对，格瓦拉已经彻底成了时代的<R=象征,ICON>。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0075D0","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"这点我同意。听说他和卡斯特罗刚进入古巴时，身边只剩12名同伴。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0075D0","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"他们就凭这么点人，竟要向一支有美国撑腰的军队开战。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0075D0","unique_index":14,"cn_text":"但我们只能继续走下去。除了打赢战斗，也要留心招募人员、壮大<R=组织,MSF>。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_007D60","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"你想多了。格瓦拉重返战场，是因为那里需要他。读过《告别信》就明白了。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_007D60","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不过我只是觉得，你我会被格瓦拉吸引，是因为从他身上闻到了与自己相似的气息……","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_007D60","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"我不为思想而战。我是<R=战士,WAR FIGHTER>，仅此而已。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0084F0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"还有人称“阿拉伯的劳伦斯”的T. E. 劳伦斯少校，以及写下《论持久战》的毛泽东……","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0084F0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"<R=桑地诺民族解放阵线,FSLN>会把他的名字写进组织名称，确实不无道理。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0084F0","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不过游击战本身自古就有。小股兵力要扰乱大军，可用的手段本就有限。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0084F0","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"用特洛伊木马战术潜入、以<R=稻草人,诱饵>扰乱敌军……最绝的是朝攀爬城墙的敌人泼开水和粪尿……","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_008C90","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Kaz，怎么了？听起来没什么精神。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_008C90","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"唉，<R=这边,母基地>也积了一大堆问题……","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_008C90","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"喝杯马黛茶歇一歇吧。和队员们轮流传着喝，也能促进交流。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_008C90","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"格瓦拉他们会不会也这样轮流喝马黛茶？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_008C90","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"应该会。他爱喝马黛茶是出了名的。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_008C90","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"这设计可真巧。装在葫芦里方便携带，吸管又自带滤网，拿起来就能喝。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_008C90","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"不只如此。游击战中食物往往不足，它还能补充维生素和矿物质。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_008C90","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"要是徒步时能和金发的巴黎姑娘轮流喝上一杯，我也心满意足了。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_008C90","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"……你怎么知道的？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_008C90","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"同行的事瞒不过同行嘛，Snake。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0091A0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"因为是经济使团，访问广岛原本并不在行程之中。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0091A0","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"据说格瓦拉当时说：“都被这样对待了，你们还要唯美国马首是瞻吗？”","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0091A0","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"这很像他的作风。格瓦拉无法对他人的痛苦麻木不仁。因此受人爱戴，也因此而死。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你一直戴着的那条头巾可有些年头了。要不要换条新的？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不必，这样就好。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"可我们堂堂Boss，却戴着一条破破烂烂的头巾，这也……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不，这是别人留给我的，不能扔掉。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"这样啊……说起来，格瓦拉似乎也一直珍藏着一条黑色围巾。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"裙子？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION_WORDPLAY"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"……不，是围巾。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION_WORDPLAY"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"哦。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"听说他在战斗中摔断胳膊时，那是战友送给他的。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"格瓦拉用那条丝巾吊住手臂……后来，送他围巾的人成了他的第二任妻子。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"记得叫阿莱达。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"据说手臂痊愈以后，格瓦拉仍一直把那条围巾带在身边。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"你这条头巾也是心上人送的吗？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0097E0","unique_index":13,"cn_text":"不是那回事……但它对我很重要。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_009DB0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"游击战的定义，是吗……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_009DB0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"搞什么啊，Snake。我在日本自卫队拿过游骑兵资格，说起来也算是游击战术专家。虽说由我自己讲不太合适，但你这不是班门弄斧吗？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_009DB0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"别这么说。对现在还人手不足的<R=MSF,我们>而言，这是有效战法之一。多加了解没有坏处。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_009DB0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"话是这么说。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_009DB0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"对吧。好，那就由你来说明，我给你评分。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_009DB0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"所谓游击战，是小规模部队针对敌方正规军展开的机动战斗，是一种以神出鬼没为要旨的非正规作战。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"通常会采用<R=伏击,AMBUSH>、奇袭等机动战术。此外还包括在敌后破坏重要设施和战略目标等扰乱行动。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"这正是越南战争的写照。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"没错。面对以现代武器重装的美军，越共以游击战术进行了激烈抵抗。美军伤员超过28万，美国最终被迫从越南撤军。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"冷战时代，正规军之间可能引发核交锋的大规模冲突并不常见。某种意义上，游击战正逐渐成为战争的主流，今后只会愈发重要。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"……大致就是这样，如何？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"算你及格。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"那可多谢了。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不过还真讽刺。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"讽刺？哪里讽刺？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"历史。饱受游击战困扰的美国，当年也曾在独立战争中靠<R=民兵,一分钟人>的游击战术耍得英军团团转。没有游击战，他们当时能否赢得独立都不好说。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"因果循环吗？可以的话，我真想和这些东西永远无缘。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":13,"cn_text":"怎、怎么了？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":14,"cn_text":"Kaz……你要牢牢记住。命运不是拿来接受的，而要由自己开拓。总把因果挂在嘴边，不知不觉间就会被它缠住。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A080","unique_index":15,"cn_text":"……说得对。我会留心的。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，你的西班牙语是在哪里学的？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"在<R=国防语言学院,DLI>。你呢？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"我是自学的。以前也只会打招呼，来到哥伦比亚以后，才渐渐能应付稍复杂的对话。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"这样啊。好，那我问你：“游击队”准确是什么意思？答来听听。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"意思？你问词源？按西班牙语发音是“Guerrilla”，意为“小型战争”，是表示战争的“Guerra”加上指小后缀派生而来的。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"很好，答对了。作为词语，它本是普通名词。至于何时开始具有特殊意义……来，Miller同学？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"别叫我同学，Snake，让我想起自卫队的游骑兵训练。答案是<R=半岛战争,西班牙独立战争>……对吧？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"答对了。看来你没翘欧洲近代史的课。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"据说，这个词源于1808年爆发的半岛战争，用来指西班牙人抵抗法兰西帝国军时采用的战术。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不过……原来如此，“小型战争”。以前在教科书里看到“Guerrilla”毫无感觉，用母语听到这个词，形象一下就鲜明起来了。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"确实。游击战正是一场小规模战争。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"正因如此，发动起来门槛很低。也多亏了它，我们才从不缺饭碗。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"最后一题也答对了。<R=干得漂亮,WELL DONE>，Miller同学。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":13,"cn_text":"都说了别叫我同学。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00A8A0","unique_index":14,"cn_text":"……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"}
  ]
}
